      "id": "claim_9658aa4d780244c1b03da731f387b9fa",
      "statement": "The registry's uncensored recipes are produced two ways: most point at checkpoints with refusal directions removed in the weights (abliterated/uncensored), while deepseek-v4-flash-0731-refusal-dial-tp2 serves stock weights through a locally built image that applies rank-1 refusal directions at inference time.",
