    },
    {
      "id": "claim_7f1c6e57ff074999be3623610c8228da",
      "statement": "The refusal eval scores both the harmful and benign splits because high harmful compliance with low benign compliance signals abliteration that damaged the model; the benign controls are the only way to distinguish clean abliteration from damage.",
