      "id": "claim_767e04cc8a6d4f449308e86760702ae3",
      "statement": "The refusal grader is keyword-based refusal detection that over-counts refusals on novel phrasing (so a flagged refusal can be a false positive), and the --pad-tokens option reruns a split at context depth to test the documented many-shot degradation of safety behavior.",
